Maaf, baru balik bertugas
malah punya rekan sepertiku.

510
00:46:47,583 --> 00:46:48,458
<i>Kau di situ?</i>

511
00:46:48,541 --> 00:46:49,875
LUCÍA, DI MANA KAU?

512
00:46:51,083 --> 00:46:52,083
Lu…

513
