566
00:53:32,916 --> 00:53:34,583
<i>Baiklah, aku ke sana.</i>

567
00:53:36,750 --> 00:53:37,750
<i>Lari.</i>

568
00:53:38,666 --> 00:53:40,500
Baik, aku akan ke sana.

569
00:53:46,333 --> 00:53:48,625
REKANKU BARU KELUAR, BIARKAN DIA MASUK

