606
00:57:43,958 --> 00:57:45,875
<i>Aku bingung harus bilang apa lagi.</i>

607
00:57:45,958 --> 00:57:48,916
<i>Aku bekerja tiga bulan,</i>
<i>tanpa kontrak, dan tak tahu</i>

608
